**File**: `src\lib\ui\learning-objects\layout\Card.svelte`
- Line 75: `alt=""` on image that shows the card's visual (should have descriptive alt)
- Line 96: `alt=""` on the main card image (should have `cardDetails.title` or similar)

**File**: `src\lib\ui\time\StudentCard.svelte`
- Line 101: `alt=""` on the learning object image

These are not decorative images -- they are the primary visual content of cards and should have meaningful alt text.

### 3b. Breadcrumbs.svelte -- svelte-ignore for a11y suppressed rather than fixed
**File**: `src\lib\ui\navigators\buttons\Breadcrumbs.svelte`, lines 48-56

```svelte
&lt;!-- svelte-ignore a11y_no_static_element_interactions --&gt;
&lt;span
