&gt;
```

A `&lt;span&gt;` has mouse event handlers but no keyboard equivalents and no `role` attribute. The svelte a11y warning was suppressed with a comment rather than properly fixed. Keyboard users cannot trigger the expand/collapse of breadcrumb text.

### 3c. Non-semantic HTML in InfoButton.svelte
**File**: `src\lib\ui\navigators\buttons\InfoButton.svelte`, line 18

```svelte
&lt;prose class="prose dark:prose-invert"&gt;
```

`&lt;prose&gt;` is not a valid HTML element. This should be a `&lt;div&gt;` or `&lt;section&gt;` with the prose class.

### 3d. Missing keyboard navigation for Card component
**File**: `src\lib\ui\learning-objects\layout\Card.svelte`, line 152

Cards are wrapped in `&lt;a&gt;` tags (good), but the `hover:scale-[1.10]` transform has no corresponding `:focus` or `:focus-visible` style. Keyboard users navigating through cards get no visual feedback beyond browser defaults which may be insufficient with the custom styling.

