**File**: `src\lib\ui\components\NotFound.svelte`, lines 14

```svelte
&lt;h1&gt;Not Found&lt;/h1&gt;
```

The 404 page only logs params to console and shows a bare "Not Found" heading. No description, no link to home, no ARIA live region to announce the error.

